Build on LOOT

One instruction, link_coin, pairs a pump.fun coin to a brand and locks its fee split, payout, and holder floor. Holder credit and redemption happen off-chain.

Launch
#

Create a pump.fun coin and link it in one transaction.

Send create_v2 followed by link_coin. An optional dev buy goes between them. link_coin checks that the product id is in the registry and that the bonding-curve creator is still the signer, then locks the fee split and stores the payout and floor.

