Read data
#

Decode the registry and a coin's link.

Registry

Tag 5. A 3-byte header, then 69-byte records. Readers use the count. The account can grow past 256 records, up to 10MB. Record i starts at 3 + 69i. Logos and banners live at /brands/logos/{id}.png and /brands/banners/{id}.png.

Offset	Size	Field
0	1	Tag (5)
1	2	Record count, u16 LE
3 + 69i	33	Product id, length-prefixed, max 32
36 + 69i	33	Name, length-prefixed, max 32
69 + 69i	3	RGB color
